msgid ""
"The `Star Labs StarBook Horizon <https://starlabs.systems/pages/starbook-"
"horizon>`__ is :doc:`officially certified </user/hardware/certified-hardware/"
"certified-hardware>` for Qubes OS Release 4."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/hardware/certified-hardware/starlabs-starbook-horizon.rst:10
#: cfd8d668deb1441ba1347f067c87e428
msgid ""
"The `Star Labs StarBook Horizon <https://starlabs.systems/pages/starbook-"
"horizon>`__ is a 13.4-inch laptop featuring open-source coreboot firmware, "
"up to 32 GB of memory, Wi-Fi kill switch, integrated webcam cover, as well "
"as extensive firmware controls for fan, power, security, boot behavior, and "
"more."
msgstr ""

